---
/*
 * The Spanish route. The page reads its locale from `Astro.url` (`getLocale`), so rendering the same
 * component under this prefix is the whole translation: the rail's labels, the emitted demo source
 * and the catalogue endpoint it fetches all follow from it.
 *
 * It was missing, which the language switch in `Tool.astro` made impossible to ignore: this app
 * shipped `/` and `/en/` - the default locale twice - and nothing at all for the other one the
 * dictionary has been carrying all along.
 */
import PlaygroundPage from "../index.astro";
---
<PlaygroundPage />
